# Paths whose review is reserved to a specific role, rather than any reviewer.
#
# GitHub enforces these entries only under the "Require review from Code Owners"
# branch-protection rule; without it they merely auto-request the reviewer.
#
# The paths below share a shape: the automation around them checks that declarations
# agree with one another, never that a declaration should have been made at all.
# Weakening one leaves every check green, and review is what is left.

# Supply-chain controls — the pin lockfiles and the two bypass ledgers.
.github/actions-pin.toml              @Tomy-ch
.github/runners-pin.toml              @Tomy-ch
.github/go-cooldown-bypass.toml       @Tomy-ch
.github/tool-cooldown-bypass.toml     @Tomy-ch
docker/images-pin.toml                @Tomy-ch

# The Go cooldown gate reads the `go.mod` diff and covers direct requirements only,
# which leaves indirect modules to review.
scripts/go.mod                        @Tomy-ch
scripts/go.sum                        @Tomy-ch

# The version SSOT. `tool-cooldown.yaml` covers the CLI tools declared here; the
# language runtimes are exempt by the file's own declaration.
mise.toml                             @Tomy-ch

# The branch-pattern SSOT and the deployment environments (ADR-0603 決定1・4). An environment
# that allows more branches, or a pattern that protects fewer, still passes every check.
.github/settings/branches.json        @Tomy-ch
.github/settings/environments.json    @Tomy-ch

# The runner egress allowlist SSOT (bullfrog) — `make egress-apply` writes each entry out to
# every workflow that carries the job.
.github/egress.toml                   @Tomy-ch

# The Policy Test declarations (ADR-0402 決定15). Dropping a document type or a role address from
# the data, or an override from a reference root's policy input, shrinks what the Policy reads
# while every check stays green.
conftest/plan/                        @Tomy-ch
conftest/data/policy-plan.json        @Tomy-ch
usecases/*/reference/tests/policy-input.tftest.hcl  @Tomy-ch

# インフラ内コードの検出（ADR-0103 決定14）。どれを弱めても検出は緑のまま通る。
# 許可リストに本リポジトリ所有の項目を足す変更は、その項目のソースの所在の行をここに足す
# （`make infra-code-decl-check` が、所在がこの宣言で覆われていることを検査する）。
conftest/hcl/                              @Tomy-ch
conftest/data/                             @Tomy-ch
scripts/infra-code-gate/                   @Tomy-ch
scripts/lib/adrdoc/                        @Tomy-ch
scripts/tf-job-lint/                       @Tomy-ch
.makefiles/terraform/infra-code.mk         @Tomy-ch
.makefiles/terraform/infra-code-test.mk    @Tomy-ch
.github/workflows/terraform-gates.yaml     @Tomy-ch
.github/settings/branch-protection.json    @Tomy-ch
.github/CODEOWNERS                         @Tomy-ch
